 to pink  lobulated unremarkable breast tissue with no additional discrete masses or lesions identified  Within the axillary tail multiple tan pink rubbery lymph nodes are identified ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 1 5cm in maximum dimension  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A  Posterior overlying margin of indurated irregular area  B E  Representative sections of indurated ill defined irregular area  F G  Representative section of surrounding dense fibrous tissue  H  Four whole lymph nodes  I  Five whole lymph nodes  J  Six whole lymph nodes  K  One bisected lymph node  L  One bisected lymph node  M  One bisected lymph node  N  Four whole lymph nodes  O  Six whole lymph nodes  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RANIA M  SELIEM  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Positive.
