y  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  16 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 10 03 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast mass   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm piece of breast  which is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm hard ill defined tan mass abutting numerous inked margins  Representative tumor sections are submitted in A through D  representative fibrous tissue in E and F  A representative section is frozen as frozen section  1  and submitted in G  Resident  GARY LETTS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  GARY LETTS  M D  PART   BREAST MASS  LEFT    report_end  , Positive.
